=== DK
Capacity and number of production units per municipality and type. | The dataset is updated during the first two weeks of the following month.

**Please note:** the capacities are calculated at midnight on the first day of the month.

A version, where thermal power plants are divided into main fuels, is under development.

---
**API Request Frequency** \
To get the most up-to-date data, calling the API with a dynamic timestamp such as [start=now-P3M](https://api.energidataservice.dk/dataset/CapacityPerMunicipality?start=now-P3M) is a good approach. Making one request daily is sufficient to ensure getting the latest data.
